o protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and use our services.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"2. Information We Collect\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We may collect the following types of information:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Account Information:\"}],\" Name, email address, phone number, and password when you register for an account.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Vendor Information:\"}],\" Business name, business description, logo, and booth preferences when you apply as a vendor.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Transaction Data:\"}],\" Event ticket purchases and registration details.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Usage Data:\"}],\" Pages visited, time spent on the site, browser type, and device information.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Communications:\"}],\" Messages you send us via contact forms or email.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"3. How We Use Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We use the information we collect to:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Create and manage your account\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Process event registrations and ticket purchases\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Review and process vendor applications\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Send event reminders and updates (with your consent)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Improve our website and services\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Respond to your enquiries and support requests\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Comply with legal obligations\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"4. Sharing Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Service Providers:\"}],\" Trusted third-party services that help us operate our platform (e.g., Supabase for database hosting, payment processors).\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Event Organisers:\"}],\" Relevant registration details shared with event staff for check-in purposes.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Legal Requirements:\"}],\" When required by law or to protect our rights.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"5. Data Storage and Security\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your data is stored securely using Supabase infrastructure with industry-standard encryption. We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"legal-section\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"6. Cookies\"}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\"]}],\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\"]}]]}]}],\"$La\"]}],[\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\"],\"$Ld\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"2YqB6Oykybihahb5iZdvR\"}\n3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"childre